00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.335
- But even the research here,

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start size:84% position:16%
they're monkeying
around with bird flu

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.205
and all these different flues

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:06.873
that are very contagious,

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:07.807
and they're like saying,

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.209
"Well, it's really deadly,

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:10.877
but it's not aerosolized.

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:12.712
Let's try to make
it aerosolized.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.647
Let's try to adapt
this deadly virus

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:15.849
