00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.367
from the great state
of Kentucky, Rand Paul.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.835
Welcome to the,
as you called it,

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Dungeon Rubin Report.
- Yeah.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.506 align:start size:84% position:16%
Glad to be with you.
(Dave laughs)

