00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.145
That was from rural counties.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.247
We do very well
in rural America,

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.816
not so well in urban America.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:24.317 align:start size:84% position:16%
So we have two
cities in Kentucky,

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:25.585
Louisville and Lexington,

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.554
that are of any kind
of significant size,

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:30.090
we lose those 60/40.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.659 align:start size:84% position:16%
But I think that's
part of the answer to,

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.828
you know, how we do
around the country.

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:36.296
You see, we win the geography,

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:38.531
we just don't win the
population necessarily.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.300 align:start size:84% position:16%
- How long do you
think that can hold,

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.835
