centers that are blue,

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.077
the tension between
those two areas?

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:53.780
- Well, something's gotta give,

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.116 align:start size:88% position:13%
but we're basically just
about evenly divided.

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:57.350
I mean, it's hard to believe

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.785 align:start size:84% position:16%
