election in Georgia

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.386 align:start size:84% position:16%
and there's an
almost even amount.

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.455
I mean, almost exactly
even amount of people

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.290
on either side of the divide.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:05.758
And I think people are voting

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:09.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
