they think they belong to.

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
People say, "Oh, it's
about candidate quality."

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:13.933
Well, frankly, Dr. Oz
is a great candidate.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.101
I've seen him campaign.

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.003
He's a great retail campaigner.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:19.105
He's on daytime TV, you know,

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:20.740
for goodness for
a decade or more,

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.075
He's very good with people

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:24.077
