very intelligent,

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:25.812
can answer all the questions.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:28.047 align:start size:84% position:16%
And so, I don't
think he was defeated

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:29.949 align:start size:84% position:16%
'cause he wasn't
quality of candidate,

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:32.919
I think it's that we're in
sort of these separate camps,

00:02:32.919 --> 00:02:34.687
and they are different camps.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:37.190 align:start size:97% position:3%
But frankly, it's interesting
when I meet people,

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.226
almost anybody who's
working is in our camp.

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:41.728
I mean, so it's interesting.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.029
You go into a machine shop

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:45.165 align:start size:84% position:16%
and 10 guys have
grease on their hands,

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.633 align:start size:84% position:16%
