as you come.

00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:49.936 align:start position:0%
And they're not very considerate
of people who don't work.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:52.438
In fact, they're disdainful
of people who don't work.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:54.374 align:start size:88% position:13%
But we also have a labor
force participation

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.843 align:start size:84% position:16%
where 38% of our
country doesn't work.

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.778 align:start size:84% position:16%
So, that's a huge
block of voters there.

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:01.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's also a huge block
of government voters.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:04.250 align:start size:84% position:16%
In fact, I think the
87,000 IRS agents

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.420
