it is about harassing us.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.088
Sure, they'll harass
us. That's a given.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.256
And I don't want them.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:11.191
But I think it's really about

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:13.626
87,000 more voters in Virginia.

00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:14.561
Maybe not all of them-

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:15.828 align:start size:72% position:28%
- Oh, wow!
- in Virginia,

00:03:15.828 --> 00:03:16.996
but a lot of them would
be in Northern Virginia,

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.798
that could tip the balance.

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:20.333 align:start size:81% position:19%
- So literally,
just moving people

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:21.768
from wherever to Virginia

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:22.969
just to take this job

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:24.470 align:start size:84% position:16%
because it's so close.
- Well, and also,

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.905
they're also employed for
a long time for government,

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:27.307
there's a tendency to say,

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:29.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
well, you know, deficit's
kind of a problem,

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:31.744
but then again, they
pay me really well.

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:35.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, you see how government
workers gradually

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:37.050
kinda shift over to
the Democrat party,

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.785
and most of the three counties,

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.853
