prosperity comes with freedom.

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:20.293
But it's an intangible,
it's not a concrete.

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:21.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
The other side's offering
you a cell phone.

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:23.196
You want a cell phone,

00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:24.897
you want the government
to buy you a cell phone,

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:26.899
you want the government
to pay for your college,

00:04:26.899 --> 00:04:27.834
you want the government to pay

00:04:27.834 --> 00:04:29.168
for your housing and your food.

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:31.271 align:start size:84% position:16%
And so, they're
offering something.

00:04:31.271 --> 00:04:33.773
And it's the allure of
something for nothing.

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:35.875
And the people working for
it are frustrated by it.

00:04:35.875 --> 00:04:37.644 align:start size:84% position:16%
The people receiving
are are like,

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:38.478
yeah, that's not too bad.

00:04:38.478 --> 00:04:39.312
Maybe I could use more.

00:04:39.312 --> 00:04:40.513
Maybe I could have,

00:04:40.513 --> 00:04:42.482
what about universal
basic income, you know?

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.918
- So if if things had gone
a little bit differently

00:04:45.918 --> 00:04:48.621
and the senate had broke red,

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:50.590
would you be licking
your chops right now,

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:52.225
figuring out what
to do with Fauci,

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:54.093
and figuring out what-
- We still are gonna try?

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.762
It's obviously not ideal

00:04:55.762 --> 00:04:57.897
but I'm gonna try hard to
convince the Democrats.

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:02.135
I don't know if you
read Nicholas Wade's
article in Medium.

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:03.636
This came out about a year ago

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:07.073
and it was the article
that awoke everybody

00:05:07.073 --> 00:05:08.474 align:start size:81% position:19%
I hadn't even paid
much attention

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:10.143
to the lab leak until
I read his article.

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:12.612
It's like 40, 50 page article.

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:14.180
No one would touch it.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.648 align:start size:84% position:16%
None of the mainstream
media would print.

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:19.152
He printed it on Medium,
which is a self publication

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:20.787
but it's incredibly well done.

00:05:20.787 --> 00:05:22.822
He's written for nature, science

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:24.324
New York Times science writer.

00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:27.894 align:start size:97% position:3%
And he writes this and
it's just an amazing reveal

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:30.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
of how the science points
towards this coming

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:33.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
from the lab and that
there has been a coverup.

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.903 align:start size:97% position:3%
So anyway, I sent that
article to leading Democrats

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:39.672
on the Homeland Security
that has the oversight

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:42.575 align:start size:88% position:13%
to investigate this
with the hope that maybe

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:44.477
one of them will read
it and go, my God,

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:47.480
we should investigate this
or this could happen again.

00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:50.149 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Where does that
hope stand right now?

00:05:50.149 --> 00:05:51.651 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, does anyone who
you send them these things,

00:05:51.651 --> 00:05:53.052
does anyone care?

00:05:53.052 --> 00:05:54.620
- I've tried for
two years to get

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.256
any kind of hearing and
have not had any luck.

00:05:57.256 --> 00:05:58.758
But I think some of it is,

00:05:58.758 --> 00:06:00.560
it became very public, the
squabble with Dr. Fauci.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:04.564 align:start size:84% position:16%
And he became the
paragon of government.

00:06:04.564 --> 00:06:06.499 align:start size:88% position:13%
And they, the Democrats
love government.

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:08.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
So they don't want anyone
attacking government.

00:06:08.668 --> 00:06:11.671
But the really, the look
into the virus's origins

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:12.739
isn't an attack of Biden.

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:14.307
In fact, most of this happened

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:15.942 align:start size:88% position:13%
under the Trump
administration, frankly,

00:06:15.942 --> 00:06:18.878
and under the maybe
Obama administration.

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:21.280
But letting go of
gain of function,

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.750
letting gain of function
research get started again,

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.551
really, there was a pause

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:27.520
and I think they were
disobeying the pause

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:30.256 align:start position:0%
but then really it happened
under the Trump administration.

00:06:30.256 --> 00:06:32.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't think Trump had
any idea what was going on

00:06:32.258 --> 00:06:33.993 align:start size:88% position:13%
but it did happen during
his administration.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:35.995
So it really isn't
pointing fingers

00:06:35.995 --> 00:06:37.630
at one president or the other.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's really about getting
to the bottom of this

00:06:39.432 --> 00:06:40.566
so this doesn't happen again.

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:41.868
- So even if you had the Senate

00:06:41.868 --> 00:06:43.169 align:start size:84% position:16%
and you were in charge
of the committee

00:06:43.169 --> 00:06:44.971 align:start size:88% position:13%
that was, you know,
putting Fauci out there

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:46.305
and dealing with all of that,

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:48.441
it's not like much
happens after, right.

00:06:48.441 --> 00:06:49.675
I think that's one of the things

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:50.610
people are always
confused about.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:51.844
Like, we have these hearings

00:06:51.844 --> 00:06:53.045
then does anything
ever actually come,

00:06:53.045 --> 00:06:54.680
- I think people
want some, you know

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.683
people at the Trump rallies
say, lock them up, you know.

00:06:57.683 --> 00:06:58.918
They want somebody locked up.

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:00.787
And frankly, if you
lie to Congress,

00:07:00.787 --> 00:07:02.655
if you're a Republican
they do lock you up.

00:07:02.655 --> 00:07:04.390 align:start size:84% position:16%
If you're a Democrat,
they ignore you.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:07.026
But I don't have any,
I guess naive hopes,

00:07:07.026 --> 00:07:08.261
that that would happen.

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:09.362 align:start size:81% position:19%
If you did lie,
and if Fauci lied,

00:07:09.362 --> 00:07:11.030
yes you should go to jail.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.833 align:start size:88% position:13%
But they control the
DOJ. And so, I see that.

00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:16.402 align:start size:97% position:3%
My hope is still this, even
in the minority in the Senate,

00:07:16.402 --> 00:07:18.271
my hope is to win the argument,

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:21.274 align:start size:97% position:3%
convince the public and
then do something about it.

00:07:21.274 --> 00:07:23.776 align:start size:84% position:16%
And that doesn't
mean necessarily
someone goes to jail.

00:07:23.776 --> 00:07:26.679
What it means is that
we regulate gain of
function research.

00:07:26.679 --> 00:07:30.349
Our tax dollars number one,
shouldn't go to Wuhan, China.

00:07:30.349 --> 00:07:31.818
Period.

00:07:31.818 --> 00:07:33.052
Even if they're, you know,

00:07:33.052 --> 00:07:34.587 align:start size:84% position:16%
just trying to
discover a penicillin,

00:07:34.587 --> 00:07:35.888
I wouldn't send them
the money to do it

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:36.956
'cause I don't trust them.

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:38.257
And we don't have any money.

00:07:38.257 --> 00:07:39.892
We're borrowing it from
them to send it to them.

00:07:39.892 --> 00:07:41.461
So, it doesn't make any sense.

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:42.628
So, I wouldn't send any money

00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:44.597 align:start size:88% position:13%
to most foreign
countries for research.

00:07:44.597 --> 00:07:46.199
Let's do some research here.

00:07:46.199 --> 00:07:48.468
But even the research here,

00:07:48.468 --> 00:07:50.503 align:start size:84% position:16%
they're monkeying
around with bird flu

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:52.972 align:start size:97% position:3%
and all these different flues
that are very contagious

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:54.474
and they're like saying,

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:57.009
well it's really deadly
but it's not aerosolized.

00:07:57.009 --> 00:07:58.811
Let's try to make
it aerosolized.

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.379
Let's try to adapt
this deadly virus

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:01.814
that doesn't spread very easily.

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:03.983 align:start size:84% position:16%
Let's see if we can
make it spread easier.

00:08:03.983 --> 00:08:05.384
It's a death wish.

00:08:05.384 --> 00:08:07.286
So, we did have one
subcommittee hearing

00:08:07.286 --> 00:08:08.855 align:start size:84% position:16%
and I had three
scientists come in.

00:08:08.855 --> 00:08:10.356
They're not partisans

00:08:10.356 --> 00:08:11.991
